  "readmeFile": "README.nuget.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.2.0 — adds AddressLookupTableProgram.FreezeLookupTable (the last missing ALT instruction) and extends AuthorityType with the full Token-2022 authority set (TransferFeeConfig through PermissionedBurn), so TokenProgram.SetAuthority can change extension authorities on Token-2022 mints and accounts. Signing and verification now use BouncyCastle's span-based Ed25519 APIs — fewer allocations on the hot signing path, same behavior. Fixes: TransactionBuilder.SetRecentBlockhash now clears a previously set durable nonce (dropping its prepended AdvanceNonceAccount); Transaction.Deserialize rejects a signature count that does not match the message's required signatures (FormatException, matching Solana's sanitize rule); SolanaUnits.SolToLamports throws the documented ArgumentOutOfRangeException instead of OverflowException for oversized amounts. No breaking changes. Changelog: https://github.com/jecacs/SolSharp/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
